[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_3A_VERTICAL]
Vertical Turret

[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_3A_VERTICAL_desc]
Please remember, the turret must have a slight angle, otherwise if you shoot straight up, you will hit a target accurately — just not the target you wanted.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_3A_VERTICAL]
垂直炮塔

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_3A_VERTICAL_desc]
请记住，炮塔是必须有个微小倾斜角度的，否则如果你朝正上方开炮，你将会精准命中一个目标——不是你想要的那个目标。
